# 两个纯 Kd 颜色材质：InnoVault 的 MtlParser 支持 newmtl / Kd / map_Kd / d / Tr，
# 纯色材质不需要贴图——BasicEffect 会直接用 Kd 做漫反射色。
#
# Two flat Kd color materials. InnoVault's MtlParser understands
# newmtl / Kd / map_Kd / d / Tr; with color-only materials no texture is needed,
# BasicEffect just uses Kd as the diffuse color.

# 主体：淡冰蓝 / body: icy blue
newmtl CrystalBody
Kd 0.62 0.86 1.0

# 中段棱带：亮紫 / girdle band: bright violet
newmtl CrystalGirdle
Kd 0.52 0.36 0.98
